  "description": "Jeong-chan has been in love with his best friend’s mother for a long time. When he finally confesses his feelings, she turns him down—but not without setting a condition. She tells him he must first experience other kinds of love before she will consider his feelings.  Following her condition, Jeong-chan begins getting involved with various women, each possessing her own unique charm. Through these encounters he comes face to face with the many different faces of love, desire, and devotion.\n\n\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/I_love_you_very_much)",
